  "display_title": "Rom-comixxx!",
  "description": "Rom-comixxx is the one and only student club for comic book lovers at Turnon University. And as one might guess, the club treads a fine line between naughty and nice--a fact that appalls Sun-jung, a new member who is an aspiring romance comic artist. Nevertheless, Rom-comixxx is Sun-jung’s only link to the comic world, and it might shut down if they don’t find more members! Can she and the oddball club president recruit enough members to create the greatest (and spiciest) comic ever?! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
